# artifacts/ — Evaluation outputs, metric reports, SHAP plots, split files
#
# All generated artifacts are git-ignored. Use versioned filenames only.
#
# Subdirectory layout (created at runtime):
#   artifacts/
#   ├── splits/       — train/test split CSVs/parquets (Phase 3)
#   ├── chroma_db/    — Chroma vector DB persistence (Phase 10)
#   └── *.json        — metric reports (Phases 4–9)
